# Engineering workflow

**Why:** Structure-first work reduces review churn and token waste from blind edits.

## Detection (see docs/architecture-profiles.md)

1. Next.js `app/` → read `nextjs-developer.md`
2. `src/components/atoms` → default layered React SPA
3. API-only → `node-api-developer.md`
4. Else graphify + neighbors — do not impose foreign layouts

## Pipeline

1. Discovery (`codebase-discovery.mdc`)
2. `devkit` → `list_handbook`
3. Implement with matching rules/agents
4. `yarn lint:fix` / `yarn test` / `yarn build`
5. `pre_pr_quality_gate` → `ready`
6. `repo_open_pr` (needs `GITHUB_TOKEN`)

Prefer **`devkit`** in chat over standalone tools unless debugging.
